Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.95,0:00:11.99,OpeningQuote,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2025,0)}"We never forget what we endeavor to forget."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:11.99,QuoteAttribution,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1025,0)\q2\pos(578,250)}F.W. Nietzsche, "The Dawn of Day"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:19.69,Italics,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I've never thought of myself as \Na good person or a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:22.94,Italics,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Since arriving at this school,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:22.63,Main_Top,Shiranami,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Honami-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:24.46,Main_Top,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Oh, it really isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:27.78,Italics,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I've sworn I'd face whatever \Ncame at me head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:26.86,Main_Top,Kobashi,0,0,0,,You're always so humble!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:30.72,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\c&H101312&\fax.2\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\shad0\b1\fay-.18\pos(270,271.334)\frz2.564\frx8\fry340}Student Council Room
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:34.97,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Hey, Sakayanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:37.48,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Yes, President Nagumo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:41.90,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Does this student council \Nroom even serve any purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.25,0:00:45.02,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Couldn't we use it as a \Nkaraoke box or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.90,0:00:48.99,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Wherever I am is the student council room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.99,0:00:51.21,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,That's a unique viewpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.25,0:00:52.96,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.45,0:00:57.05,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,If you're not seeking entry \Ninto the student council,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:00:59.00,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,what is it that you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:03.17,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It regards the student council \Nofficer, Ichinose Honami-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:04.75,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,President Nagumo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:10.13,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I'm about to mount an attack on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:16.42,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It could potentially result in her expulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:18.14,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,If it does, I beg your forbearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.38,0:01:21.77,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,I thought I told you not to \Nescalate beyond bullying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:25.90,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I was thinking of going a bit more extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:29.61,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,I was hoping to keep her \Nfor my own amusement.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.61,0:01:32.86,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,We must always account for the unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:37.46,Main,Nagumo,0,0,0,,You're a bold girl.
