Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.82,0:03:09.84,Main_Top,Hasebe,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:11.44,Main_Top,Sakura,0,0,0,,Oh, morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.07,0:03:11.44,Main_Top,Ike,0,0,0,,What's first period again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.07,0:03:13.71,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,So it's not because you have a \Nnew boyfriend, Karuizawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:13.71,Main_Top,Sudo,0,0,0,,It's math, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.71,0:03:17.64,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,I just felt like it was time \Nto come into my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:21.18,Main,Karuizawa,0,0,0,,It was just too easy to depend \Non Yosuke-kun, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:20.36,Main_Top,Sakura,0,0,0,,Morning, Kiyotaka-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:21.18,Main_Top,Hasebe,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:21.64,Main_Top,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:24.14,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,Wow! That's so grown-up of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:27.02,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Things are lively in here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:30.02,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,It appears Karuizawa-san \Nand Hirata-kun broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:34.03,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,And that's got the class all worked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.03,0:03:37.45,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You seemed close to both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:38.91,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Were you aware?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.91,0:03:41.10,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Of course I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:43.19,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I don't discuss their private lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:45.18,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Hey, Hirata!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:48.69,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I hear Karuizawa dumped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.69,0:03:49.54,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:51.92,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Hey, it's all good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:55.15,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Knock it off, Yamauchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:57.80,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,But a hot guy got dumped!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:04:00.11,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,You gotta comfort the guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.49,0:04:01.55,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Sorry 'bout that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.00,0:04:03.80,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Learn a little tact, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:05.31,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Lemme go, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:07.59,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,How can you guys be so calm about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.59,0:04:08.95,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,It's not that we're calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.95,0:04:10.90,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,It's just kind of depressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:12.09,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Aw, you're so boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.09,0:04:13.54,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.53,0:04:17.19,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Would Yamauchi Haruki-kun be here, by chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.61,0:04:21.95,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:24.77,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Might I have a moment of your time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:28.59,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Lemme go, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.73,0:04:31.94,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,O-Of course, I've got time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:34.71,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.97,0:04:41.08,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,The truth is, I've wanted to \Nspeak with you for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:42.92,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,What? Really? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:43.97,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,She's going all-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:46.33,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It's a bit noisy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:48.48,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I'll meet you over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:50.73,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.19,0:04:53.06,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,No way, no way! This is impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:53.91,Main_Top,Class,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:54.98,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:54.98,Main_Top,Class,0,0,0,,Why in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:56.86,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,There's no mystery here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.86,0:04:58.60,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Ike.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:05:00.54,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Wait just a minute, Yamauchi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:01.74,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:03.32,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,This is a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.32,0:05:04.33,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.33,0:05:07.31,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,She has absolutely no reason \Nto want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.31,0:05:08.79,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,What the hell does that mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.03,0:05:12.01,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It does kinda sound like an insult, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.51,0:05:14.54,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Look, I'm only gonna say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.54,0:05:18.55,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I am this class's lethal weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.55,0:05:19.53,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.41,0:05:24.59,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,So it's gonna be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.59,0:05:27.72,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I won't reveal \Nany sensitive info!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:29.90,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Sakayanagi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:37.82,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,Does Sakayanagi-san really \Nlike Yamauchi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.30,0:05:40.91,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,What do you think, Kiyo-pon, Yukimoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.91,0:05:43.32,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,I don't know much about that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.59,0:05:46.89,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,They've never interacted before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:50.33,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It seems hasty to assume it \Ndirectly relates to romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.54,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,You're so level-headed, Kiyo-pon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:57.10,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,I could see it with Hirata-kun, \Nbut not Yamauchi-kun so much, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.57,0:05:59.09,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,Speaking of Hirata-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:03.29,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,I always figured he'd break up \Nwith Karuizawa-san eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.29,0:06:05.00,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:06.85,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,They weren't exactly a great match.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.10,0:06:11.10,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,I think Hirata-kun is more into \Nthe quiet, beautiful type.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:14.44,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,I always thought Karuizawa-san \Nwas very pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.13,0:06:17.23,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Don't you think so, Kiyotaka-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:18.62,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.99,0:06:22.92,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,Well, the point is that \NHirata-kun is single now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.92,0:06:25.66,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,And there are quite a few girls \Nwith their eyes on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:27.49,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.49,0:06:29.89,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,What, you never noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:33.52,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Let's cut the gossip and \Nstart studying for finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.52,0:06:36.03,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,A failing score means expulsion, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.03,0:06:38.25,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,What, we have to do that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.25,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(225,0)\fs12\bord0\shad0\c&HD3CE64&\b1\frx20\fry0\pos(326.667,144.666)\frz347.9\fax-.1}Message Received
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.25,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(225,0)\fs12\bord0\shad0\c&HEBE1DD&\b1\frx20\fry0\frz347.9\an8\fs14\fax-.1\pos(302,201.333)}Sender: Unlisted
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.25,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(225,0)\fs8\bord0\shad0\c&HEBE1DD&\b1\frx20\fry0\an8\fs14\fax-.1\pos(210,246.667)\frz348.5}Cancel
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.77,0:06:38.25,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(225,0)\fs8\bord0\shad0\c&H3CED81&\b1\frx20\fry0\an8\fs14\fax-.1\frz348.5\pos(356,277.333)}Open
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:39.67,Main,Hasebe,0,0,0,,Can't it wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:40.75,Main,Yukimura,0,0,0,,Take this seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.69,0:06:47.51,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Sorry to ask you to meet me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.95,0:06:48.80,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.95,0:06:51.01,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.35,0:06:54.77,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,You can call me Mii-chan. \NEveryone else does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:57.56,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's a tall order.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:06:59.30,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:01.68,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What did you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:06.28,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Um... could you tell me about Hirata-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.55,0:07:07.94,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Why ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:10.78,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm not especially close to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:15.34,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,But I hear you're the one \Nhe relies on most of all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:21.32,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Um... does Hirata-kun have his \Neye on anyone in particular?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.03,0:07:23.55,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:25.05,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:27.71,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I can't be entirely certain,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.71,0:07:30.32,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,but Karuizawa only just broke \Nup with him, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.07,0:07:32.44,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.62,0:07:36.77,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Do you think I might have a chance with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:40.04,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:42.25,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:43.86,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,But...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:45.85,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Hirata is a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:52.05,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,So he'll probably be cautious \Nabout dating again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:59.65,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,He may be feeling guilty about \Nfailing to make Karuizawa happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:03.03,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Yeah, Hirata-kun is nice like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.03,0:08:07.60,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If you go after him too quickly, \Nit may not turn out in your favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.41,0:08:09.72,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:12.82,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Slow and steady, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.82,0:08:13.78,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.78,0:08:16.35,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It's all about the one who laughs last.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.65,0:08:23.03,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,I think I had the wrong idea \Nabout you, Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.03,0:08:24.11,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The wrong idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:26.56,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,You don't talk very much,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.56,0:08:29.34,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,so I thought you'd be kind of scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:33.04,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,But I think I see why \NHirata-kun relies on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.87,0:08:36.32,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,You're really easy to talk to!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:41.33,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,I feel like you were really \Nlistening to every word I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:43.63,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Oh? Could this be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:45.53,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Hiyori-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.53,0:08:47.51,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,A date of some sort?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.51,0:08:49.63,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,N-No! Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:53.64,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Then you wouldn't mind if I joined you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:55.49,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:57.14,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Is that all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.14,0:08:58.28,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.28,0:09:01.08,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Well, what we were we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:03.80,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I was thinking of visiting China sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.22,0:09:09.28,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Oh, because Mii-chan is a \NChinese exchange student, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:14.16,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,Um... are you two friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.16,0:09:17.33,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,Yes. We read together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:19.91,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Well, that's technically correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:21.44,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.44,0:09:25.23,Main,Wang,0,0,0,,It's great that you can make \Nfriends in other classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.23,0:09:27.05,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.34,0:09:31.84,Main,Hiyori,0,0,0,,You can't have a real school life \Nif you're antagonistic all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:40.43,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:42.31,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.27,0:09:45.22,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,It was hard to express via email.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:49.64,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Seems like I'm giving a lot of advice today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:54.47,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,There are strange rumors \Nswirling around Ichinose-san.
