Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:03.37,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:07.01,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Put simply, they're slander.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.91,0:10:09.80,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What specifically do they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.71,0:10:12.22,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I summarized them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.35,0:10:16.68,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.68,0:10:18.49,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,It feels malicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.89,0:10:21.44,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But the rumors are entirely baseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.90,0:10:24.56,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,They could easily be written \Noff as the product of jealousy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.94,0:10:29.49,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,They're spreading among the \Nfirst-years too quickly for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.12,0:10:34.20,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Which suggests someone's actively \Nworking to spread them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.79,0:10:39.38,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Kanzaki-kun and the others from Class B \Nthink the rumors originate with Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.14,0:10:43.58,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sakayanagi or Katsuragi, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:47.25,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,It seems far too obvious for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:49.84,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,That's the part that concerns me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.05,0:10:55.09,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What if we assume there's \Nsome truth to the rumor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:57.54,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Even if the rest were completely made up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.54,0:11:00.46,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,that would greatly add to their plausibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:03.49,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Has Ichinose denied the rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.49,0:11:06.18,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,No, not as of yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.18,0:11:07.85,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,We should wait and watch, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.17,0:11:10.86,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Even more so if they came from Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.82,0:11:14.61,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,We have no reason to intervene.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.25,0:11:17.99,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,There's a chance it could make \NIchinose perceive us as enemies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.87,0:11:35.84,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,What would my brother do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.98,0:11:47.73,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Sorry to call you over \Nthis late, Ichinose-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.73,0:11:49.57,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Oh, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.57,0:11:52.11,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,You're doing it because \Nyou care about me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.64,0:11:54.99,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,You, too, Ayanokoji-kun. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:58.31,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm just tagging along with Horikita, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.17,0:12:01.49,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It's about the rumors, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:05.82,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Yes. Do you have any idea \Nwho's spreading them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:11.18,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I can't say for certain, but I \Nthink it might be Sakayanagi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.56,0:12:13.03,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,What makes you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.34,0:12:19.89,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,She kind of... declared war on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.39,0:12:24.89,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I guess that's not convincing \Non its own, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.13,0:12:28.98,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Class A has determined Class B \Na threat worthy of destroying,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:32.64,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,and is harming you by spreading \Nbaseless rumors about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:36.23,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I'm not sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.67,0:12:41.74,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I think it should be up to you \Nwhether you believe a rumor or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:47.12,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I feel like the best way to fight \NSakayanagi-san is to stay silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:52.88,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,That will prevent collateral \Ndamage to Class B and Class C.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.57,0:12:54.88,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You're a strong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.24,0:12:59.88,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You're thinking about not just yourself, \Nbut the others around you, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:02.89,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I don't think it's anything all that special.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.29,0:13:04.15,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Then let's work togeth—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.15,0:13:06.85,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Please don't get involved in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:12.15,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,There's no need for you guys to get \Non Sakayanagi-san's bad side, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.67,0:13:14.65,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You're sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.92,0:13:16.40,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:21.01,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Thanks so much for worrying about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.01,0:13:23.37,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But I swear I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.61,0:13:26.15,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Thanks for having me by today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.57,0:13:27.40,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.21,0:13:36.55,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Like I said before, we shouldn't get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:39.87,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If Sakayanagi is the rumors' source,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.87,0:13:45.27,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,we would put our own class in \Nthe cross hairs by getting involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:50.81,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,But if she takes Ichinose-san down, \Nshe'll come after us next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.05,0:13:54.04,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,At which time Class B \Nwill already be crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:55.67,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's beneficial to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.67,0:13:58.65,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You don't care what happens to Ichinose-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.77,0:14:01.36,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You're a very cold person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.18,0:14:05.57,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Isn't that the stance you've always taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.35,0:14:09.38,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,We'll eventually have to fight \Nand defeat her, regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.87,0:14:12.42,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,We have a common enemy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.42,0:14:15.58,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,We can take down Class A and \Nthen duke it out with Class B.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:17.34,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Pure idealism.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.70,0:14:19.94,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.20,0:14:22.13,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:33.85,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You're still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.47,0:14:37.72,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Could we talk a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:43.60,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I don't know quite what to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.68,0:14:46.62,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I really am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:48.25,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:54.37,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It seems like those rumors have \Nyou really worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:15:00.50,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I really don't want you \Nguys to worry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.93,0:15:04.23,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Is that what you're telling \Nthe members of Class B, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:05.36,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:11.01,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,That's the line I'm sticking \Nto until the rumors go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:15.05,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,That's all I had to say, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.67,0:15:17.52,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Thanks for listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:19.05,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:35.21,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnGeorgia\bord1\shad0\3c&HFCFDF8&\blur1\fs18\3a&H60&\frz356.7\frx18\fry352\pos(340,14)}Unregistered Number
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:38.46,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:42.62,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Talk, or I'm hanging up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.71,0:15:45.97,Main,Ishigami,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji Kiyotaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.07,0:15:48.09,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.29,0:15:55.22,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,They're making their move, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:01.41,Main,Amikura,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:03.04,Main,Amikura,0,0,0,,Who put this in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.04,0:16:04.45,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.45,0:16:05.96,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,Let me look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.49,0:16:10.21,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Something going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:12.62,Main,Katsuragi,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:16.55,Main,Katsuragi,0,0,0,,A strange letter was placed \Ninto all of our mailboxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:18.18,Main,Katsuragi,0,0,0,,This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:24.25,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,"Ichinose Honami is a criminal."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:27.08,Main,Katsuragi,0,0,0,,The ridiculous rumors have spread this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.71,0:16:31.95,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,After a blatant act like this, \Nthe school will have to get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.95,0:16:36.27,Main,Katsuragi,0,0,0,,And I'm sure the culprit is aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:40.02,Main,Totsuka,0,0,0,,Y-You know who the culprit is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.02,0:16:42.02,Main,Katsuragi,0,0,0,,I can't be certain, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.99,0:16:45.67,Main,Amikura,0,0,0,,Come on, you don't have to \Ngrin and bear it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.67,0:16:47.46,Main,Amikura,0,0,0,,Let's talk to the teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:49.73,Main,Amikura,0,0,0,,It's getting really ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.73,0:16:52.57,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,Yeah. You're an innocent victim here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:54.16,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.16,0:16:57.27,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,This isn't enough to get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.27,0:16:58.40,Main,Amikura,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:01.71,Main,Amikura,0,0,0,,If you don't do something, \Nthe rumors will just keep spreading!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.71,0:17:04.28,Main,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,Yeah, we need definitive action here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:07.57,Main,Amikura,0,0,0,,Sooner or later it's all going to go too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.83,0:17:13.14,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Hey, can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.77,0:17:16.98,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You're from Class A, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:18.50,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Kamuro Masumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.03,0:17:23.86,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Your room is extremely plain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:28.61,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's the first thing you have to say \Nafter forcing your way into my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:30.36,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Forcing my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:32.11,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,I believe I got your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.11,0:17:34.87,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,So, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.87,0:17:37.67,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,It's going to be a long story, \Nso you should get me a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.57,0:17:41.62,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Coffee or tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:42.98,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Do you have cocoa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:44.13,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.13,0:17:45.55,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,I'll have that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.01,0:17:52.01,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I offered two choices, \Nand she came up with a third one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.49,0:17:59.02,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You're not drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.23,0:18:01.07,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Are you wary of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:04.02,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:08.21,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,A girl I've never spoken to before—\None from Class A, at that—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:10.03,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,is in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:13.40,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,You're not at all like \Nyour classmate, Yamauchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:18.54,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,What did you think of that \Nletter about Ichinose?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:20.29,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:23.27,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Even if you didn't, you probably \Nthought about it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.87,0:18:26.69,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Whether Ichinose is a good \Nperson or a bad person?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:30.80,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Being a criminal doesn't necessarily \Nmake you a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.80,0:18:34.09,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Sakayanagi knows a secret about Ichinose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:36.10,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:41.44,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Just so you know, Sakayanagi doesn't \Nknow I'm here talking to you about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.39,0:18:44.31,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'd be angry if she knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.89,0:18:47.07,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.32,0:18:54.82,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going to tell \Nyou what Ichinose is hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.53,0:19:04.71,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,But first, I need to tell you \Nwhy Sakayanagi works me so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.55,0:19:09.55,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,It was after the entrance ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.10,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.27,0:19:27.35,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,You shoplifted, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:33.61,Flashback,Kamuro,0,0,0,,So what if I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.91,0:19:36.49,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Your technique was impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.49,0:19:38.17,Flashback,Kamuro,0,0,0,,I'll return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.17,0:19:39.24,Flashback,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.96,0:19:42.49,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,You drink alcohol?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.73,0:19:45.50,Flashback,Kamuro,0,0,0,,I don't actually, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:51.87,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,So you did it purely for the thrill, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.87,0:19:54.63,Flashback,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Why don't you just turn me \Nin to the school already?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.56,0:19:59.02,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Why don't you let me dispose of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.91,0:20:02.90,Flashback,Kamuro,0,0,0,,If you won't call them, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.69,0:20:08.06,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I like you, Kamuro Masumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:12.52,Flashback,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I think I'll make you my first friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.25,0:20:19.03,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,I was a habitual shoplifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.33,0:20:20.28,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,"Was"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:22.63,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,I don't have time for it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.63,0:20:25.29,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Sakayanagi works me too hard for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:27.54,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's why you came to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:28.79,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.57,0:20:32.60,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Ichinose's secret is the same as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.60,0:20:35.69,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,She has a history of shoplifting?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.69,0:20:37.88,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Despite what a queen bee she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.04,0:20:41.30,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,So you need to stop Sakayanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.30,0:20:43.27,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,You can make it happen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.77,0:20:45.56,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.97,0:20:49.29,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,I don't have anyone to confide in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:54.61,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,And you're the person Sakayanagi \Nis most worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:56.70,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.70,0:20:58.82,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,But I can't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:20:59.82,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.82,0:21:06.33,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I could imagine Sakayanagi choosing to \Nsacrifice you to draw me into the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.80,0:21:11.08,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,I'll prove it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.42,0:21:19.24,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.11,0:21:26.22,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It does seem genuine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.22,0:21:27.90,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.90,0:21:31.88,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,And it's not something a \Nstudent like me could buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.48,0:21:36.73,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I suppose I have to believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.73,0:21:38.52,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.91,0:21:40.24,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Good luck to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.24,0:21:42.53,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Take this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.25,0:21:44.54,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.62,0:21:51.62,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\an8\fnGeorgia\bord1\shad0\3c&HFCFDF8&\blur1\fs18\3a&H60&\frx10\fry2\pos(285.334,112)\frz4.532}Horikita Manabu
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.05,0:21:54.38,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.83,0:21:56.15,Italics,Manabu,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.00,0:21:59.18,Italics,Manabu,0,0,0,,I wanted to inform you of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.69,0:22:02.26,Main_Top,Student A,0,0,0,,What, is that real Valentine's chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.62,0:22:06.18,Italics,Manabu,0,0,0,,Kushida Kikyo has made \Ncontact with Nagumo Miyabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.26,0:22:03.54,Main_Top,Student B,0,0,0,,No, just obligation!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.68,0:22:10.02,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I see.
